1
00:00:00,454 --> 00:00:03,084
We're just standing behind her.

2
00:00:03,090 --> 00:00:06,060
(Sheldon:)It's not like we're gonna say
"boo" and scare her.

3
00:00:08,829 --> 00:00:11,659
(Penny:)How could you not tell us
you were in beauty pageants?

4
00:00:11,665 --> 00:00:13,295
'Cause it's
embarrassing.

5
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,870
(laughing):
It is; it truly is.

6
00:00:17,237 --> 00:00:18,807
(Bernadette:)Yeah, well...

7
00:00:18,805 --> 00:00:21,335
Amy writes Little House
on the Prairie fan fiction

8
00:00:21,341 --> 00:00:23,741
(Bernadette:)about herself
and posts it on the Internet.

9
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:28,310
No!

10
00:00:28,315 --> 00:00:31,685
Why? What did I do?!

11
00:00:31,685 --> 00:00:33,955
(Bernadette:)Sorry, I had to get
the spotlight off me,

12
00:00:33,954 --> 00:00:36,684
(Bernadette:)and tearing down other women
is part of my pageant training.

13
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:39,320
(Penny:)Okay. We are
reading that right now.

14
00:00:39,326 --> 00:00:40,496
(Amy:)No, please don't.

15
00:00:40,494 --> 00:00:42,624
(Bernadette:)We got embarrassed
tonight. Come on.

16
00:00:42,629 --> 00:00:43,929
(Amy:)But it's personal.

17
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:45,530
(Penny:)Why? Is it about you
and Sheldon?

18
00:00:45,532 --> 00:00:47,202
(chuckles):
No.

19
00:00:48,001 --> 00:00:50,131
(Penny:)Oh, my God, it's
about her and Sheldon.

20
00:00:50,137 --> 00:00:51,807
(Amy:)It's not about me and Sheldon.

21
00:00:51,805 --> 00:00:55,805
(Amy:)It's about a young woman
in the 1800s named Amelia...

22
00:00:55,809 --> 00:00:58,179
(Amy:)and the time-traveling physicist
named Cooper

23
00:00:58,178 --> 00:01:00,148
(Amy:)she falls in love with.

